PARITY SUMMARY (web → native, faithful reproduction)
------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Nature      : the web source is a PURE presentational card fed three props
              (authenticated, expiresAt, now) by the page — "Data sources: (none)".
              The native surface keeps the same shape: a P1/S8 source seam
              (TeslaAuthSource → @Observable TeslaAuthModel) carries the same inputs
              as a coalesced snapshot; no HTTP lives in the view.
Severity    : web severityFor() ported VERBATIM in TeslaAuthLogic.severity —
              authenticated === false ⇒ disconnected; missing/unparseable expiry ⇒
              unknown; days = floor((exp-now)/1d): <0 ⇒ expired, <=7 ⇒ warn, else ok.
              7-day boundary (warn) vs 8-day (ok) asserted; floor-toward-−∞ matches
              Math.floor bit-for-bit.
Detail      : web detail() ported in TeslaAuthLogic.detail — disconnected short-circuit;
              "Token expiry unknown" (no expiry) vs "Token expiry unparseable" (present
              but unparseable) distinction preserved; "Expired today / {n}d ago" and
              "later today / in 1 day / in {n} days" buckets reproduced.
Composition : web GlassPanel(overflow-hidden) → glass card clipped to the corner radius;
              web h-1 accent bar → TeslaAuthAccentBar (severity-tinted); lucide
              ShieldCheck/ShieldAlert/ShieldX → checkmark/exclamationmark/xmark.shield.fill;
              web <Badge variant> → scoped TeslaAuthStatusBadge (verbatim status); web
              <Link to="/tesla-account"> → TeslaAuthCTAButton (constant cyan pill, label
              switches Manage⇄Re-authenticate) delegating to the injected onManage
              (TeslaAuthCard.accountPath = "/tesla-account"); AppRoute.swift untouched
              (out of allowed-files scope).
